abstract: >-
  Five one-page Claude Code workflows run daily in a small operating team of
  one human operator and a few Claude Code sessions: memory between sessions,
  follow-up after a call, leads from the camera roll, session retro, and an
  approval gate in a messenger. Each page follows the same shape (problem,
  setup, recipe, one rule, what broke, minimum viable version). Written for
  Claude SMB trainer cohorts to reuse in workshops. Sanitized from a live
  system; no controlled comparison is reported.
